				<r3d:description language="eng">Kasetsart University Knowledge Repository is the official institutional repository of Kasetsart University, designed to collect, preserve, and disseminate the scholarly output of the university community. It serves as a central platform for accessing a wide range of academic materials, including research articles, conference proceedings, and more. 
 
In addition to traditional publications, the repository plays a vital role in supporting open science by providing access to research datasets generated by faculty, researchers, and students. Particularly in agriculture and related fields, which are areas of expertise at Kasetsart University. These datasets are curated to ensure quality, relevance, and reusability, contributing to transparency, collaboration, and the advancement of knowledge across disciplines. Can access to reseach dataset repository through URL : https://kukr.lib.ku.ac.th/kukr_es/dataset
 
By offering both publications and datasets, the repository supports long-term preservation and fosters greater visibility and impact of Kasetsart University’s research.</r3d:description>
